title: 'Vic''s question: yes to both.'
pid: 15a5f151-08e7-4626-8751-94485b417e41
body: |2-
  The removal is a rule beside the hides folder's, generalized rather than
  duplicated ('leaves_its_write_protected_folder' in 'server/refresh/visit.rs').
  Walking the ancestors costs the headline's depth, once per containers folder
  per refresh and once per changed node in the diff view.
